  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The greater the (negative value) of heat of neutralisation, the more is the strength of the acid. Hence,\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\mathrm{HCOOH}>\\mathrm{CH}_{3} \\mathrm{COOH}>\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{~S}>\\mathrm{HCN}\r\n\r\n$$",
